upstream revision
`59b3ef44fa4538296be8b7f5eeafc2a4e57d0b74` on the upstream `2.4` line:
<https://github.com/BZFlag-Dev/bzflag/commit/59b3ef44fa4538296be8b7f5eeafc2a4e57d0b74>.

